asynchronous storage mode, crash recovery, explicit joint-exit mode and arbitrary unfair schedules.\",\n        \"Application-visible Status.Config copy accuracy is a distinct responsibility.\"\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {}\n    },\n    \"rationale\": \"Ground automatic continuation without imposing a deadline; retain exploration as construction knowledge and separately preserve discovered status-copy discrepancy. Formal construction must use a fresh fixed check.\",\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"previous_id\": null,\n    \"version\": 1,\n    \"boundary_changes\": [],\n    \"obligation_checks\": {},\n    \"remaining_obligation_ids\": [\n      \"C-auto-continuation\"\n    ],\n    \"recheck_reasons\": [],\n    \"coverage_limitations\": [],\n    \"progress\": [\n      {\n        \"claim_id\": \"C-auto-continuation\",\n        \"record_status\": \"no_fixed_check\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"record\": {\n      \"path\": \"state.json\",\n      \"collection\": \"units\",\n      \"match\": {\n        \"id\": \"unit-C-auto-continuation\",\n        \"version\": 1\n      }\n    }\n  }\n]\nclaims [\n  {\n    \"id\": \"C-auto-continuation\",\n    \"kind\": \"obligation\",\n    \"concern\": \"implementation_semantics\",\n    \"description\": \"After a committed implicit joint configuration has been applied, Raft must retain implementation-owned continuation to propose its final configuration when safe and possible. A leadership transfer that expires without replacing the leader must not leave this automatic transition permanently dependent on an unrelated new client proposal when joint quorums, tick processing, transport and storage/application processing remain available.\",\n    \"scope\": {\n      \"description\": \"Automatic joint-exit continuation under a stable same-term leader following failed transfer; serialized ordinary RawNode callers, continuing required ticks and reliable transport after finite loss.\",\n      \"assumptions\": [\n        \"The initiating implicit configuration proposal actually committed and was applied; application does not reject it.\",\n        \"After finite transfer-trigger message loss, both constituent quorums remain available, all produced network messages and Ready batches are processed, and no future client proposal or campaign is required to drive the automatic transition.\",\n        \"No crashes, no Byzantine messages, ordinary configuration validation enabled.\"\n      ],\n      \"excluded\": [\n        \"Numeric deadline or immediate retry at the timeout event; no such deadline is sourced.\",\n        \"Global consensus safety, asynchronous storage mode, crash recovery, explicit joint-exit mode and arbitrary unfair schedules.\",\n        \"Application-visible Status.Config copy accuracy is a distinct responsibility.\"\n      ],\n      \"parameters\": {}\n    },\n    \"source\": \"Candidate derived from attributed implementation responsibilities\",\n    \"source_ids\": [\n      \"S-joint-contract\",\n      \"S-auto-contract\",\n      \"S-application\",\n      \"S-timeout\",\n      \"S-proposal\",\n      \"S-caller\"\n    ],\n    \"pending\": [],\n    \"assessment\": \"unassessed\",\n    \"candidate\": true,\n    \"grounding\": {\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"S-application\",\n        \"S-timeout\",\n        \"S-proposal\",\n        \"S-ready\",\n        \"S-abort\",\n        \"S-node-loop\"\n      ],\n      \"expectation_ids\": [\n        \"S-joint-contract\",\n        \"S-auto-contract\"\n      ],\n      \"binding_ids\": [\n        \"BD-auto-applied\",\n        \"BD-auto-timeout\"\n      ],\n      \"derivation\": \"ConfChangeTransitionJointImplicit specifies automatic proposal of zero configuration change, unlike JointExplicit which requires the application to propose it. ConfState.AutoLeave says Raft transitions when safe, and tracker.Config delegates automatic action to Raft when possible. appliedTo implements this duty and acknowledges transfer rejection with an intended retry. Caller duties require ticking and processing Ready, not creating unrelated client work. The requirement is continued automatic capability under sustained availability, without inventing a numeric bound.\",\n      \"applicability\": \"Only already committed/applied implicit joint state with live AutoLeave=true and stable eligible leader under ongoing fair ordinary processing.\",\n      \"unresolved\": [],\n      \"conflicts\": [],\n      \"alternatives\": [\n        \"Later application completion and successful new-leader election can restore progress, but are not guaranteed in the same-leader quiet-client scenario.\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"version\": 1,\n    \"record\": {\n      \"path\": \"state.json\",\n      \"collection\": \"claims\",\n      \"match\": {\n        \"id\": \"C-auto-continuation\",\n        \"version\": 1\n      }\n    }\n  }\n]\npending_work [\n  {\n    \"id\": \"unit-C-auto-continuation\",\n    \"candidate_id\": \"8b412541680b42dd938dc9d5945e1aed\",\n    \"kind\": \"unit\",\n    \"remaining\": [\n      \"C-auto-continuation\"\n    ],\n    \"record\": {\n      \"path\": \"state.json\",\n      \"collection\": \"units\",\n      \"match\": {\n        \"id\": \"unit-C-auto-continuation\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n]\naudit_spec_version 2\nreview_issues []\nComparison {\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"field\": {\n      \"title\": \"Field\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"op\": {\n      \"default\": \"eq\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"eq\",\n        \"ne\"\n      ],\n      \"title\": \"Op\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"value\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"integer\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"default\": null,\n      \"title\": \"Value\"\n    },\n    \"reference\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n         